#: ../../../reference/interfaces/gpio-memory-control-interface.md:2
msgid "gpio-memory-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/gpio-memory-control-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`gpio-memory-control` allows write access to all GPIO memory, via `/dev/"
"gpiomem`. This interface is restricted because it provides privileged access "
"to all GPIO devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/gpio-memory-control-interface.md:6
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/gpio-memory-control-interface.md:8
msgid "Requires snapd version _2.24+_."
msgstr ""
